vinced he would meet his end in this place of eternal darkness and despair, he instead discovered his body had undergone a bizarre mutation and somehow, he survived in a grotesque, inhuman form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With inhuman strength derived from his mutation, he laid low the lab's tormentors one by one. Those who had once subjected him to cruel experiments now shuddered violently before him, begging for mercy and pleading for their lives. But in Jack's heart burned only the blazing flame of vengeance,he would mercilessly not spare a single soul complicit in this sinister experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he pressed on with his vengeance, he gradually uncovered a shadowy, far more sinister conspiracy hidden beneath the illegal laboratory. Determined to dig deeper, he vowed to bring all sins fully into the light\u2014to spare more innocent lives from suffering, and to relentlessly seek justice for himself and those who had met an untimely end, no matter the cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERISTIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749260/extras/e6dbb5fdfe078b63bf364ff1284cf8f3.poster.avif?t=1762513193\" width=960 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749260/extras/e6dbb5fdfe078b63bf364ff1284cf8f3.webm?t=1762513193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749260/extras/e6dbb5fdfe078b63bf364ff1284cf8f3.mp4?t=1762513193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct game modes offer you unique in - game thrills through real - time combat and tactical strategy, letting you immerse yourself in diverse gameplay and discover your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla