 that are less polished than those in works from major studios\u2014I sincerely ask for your understanding and forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please rest assured that this game will not stop updating in the short term. To me, it is more like a child that requires long-term care. In the days ahead, I will continue to refine the gameplay systems, add new story chapters, and carefully listen to every player's feedback. The update speed may not be fast, but every iteration will be crafted with dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for paying attention to this indie game. Every comment and piece of feedback from you is the motivation that keeps me going. I believe that with our joint efforts, it will gradually grow into what everyone expects it to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Forest Cats Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749260/4f39dd3518d2ccffb33b147326e250a50198704c/header.jpg?t=1762513193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3749260/653189497/4b3f01e54c6c1956583128bae88b67f506cf3b5d/1760369871/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760370857","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3749260/653189497/4b3f01e54c6c1956583128bae88b67f506cf3b5d/1760369871/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760370857","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3749260/653189497/4b3f01e54c6c1956583128bae88b67f506cf3b5d/1760369871/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760370857","id":257154925,"name":"fight","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154925/b73657771e8d5182be75d2615eb480d90c22aefd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760370857"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3749260/724977221/3e126eb552c8c807b33efaa385bb169926c8ff6f/1761930744/d